if p2_score > p1_score:\n        player2_wins += 1\n    else:\n        draws += 1\n\nanswer = player1_wins - player2_wins\n```\n\n## Complexity\n- 6 categories per turn → max 36 pairs to check per game\n- 3000 games → 108,000 pair checks total\n- Very fast, no optimization needed\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":409,"cache_read_input_tokens":48462,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":409,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":25}},"requestId":"req_vrtx_011CXtDwP1HEogwCGrX7gG1y","type":"assistant","uuid":"6efec8b9-84d2-4da5-8f03-e571b3eee434","timestamp":"2026-02-07T06:20:15.499Z"}
